Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store

# ---- Python tooling cruft (Data/ generators) ----
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# ---- Deliberately KEPT in version control (documented so nobody adds them here) ----
# Data/**            game-data catalogs (mob-model-index.csv, timeline-index.csv) SHIP with the plugin
# _testing/**        generated c_/d_ entity target lists for the in-game test pass
# _archive/builds/** packaged build snapshots (latest.zip per milestone) — our recovery points
# packages.lock.json pinned NuGet graph — required for reproducible restores
# README.md, *.cs, HDM.csproj — the source of truth
